
                                                  CONFIG MERGE COMMAND


Config Merge command implements the merge functionality

----------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SWITCHES        |    DESCRIPTION
----------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   -in_t        |    Template input XML file.
   -in          |    Input XML file.
   -rule_t      |    Template rules XML file.
   -rule        |    Input rules XML file.
   -out         |    Output XML file.
   -info        |    Input XML file for infoblock merge.
   -info_t      |    Template XML file for infoblock.
   -prj_hex     |    Source input HEX file.
   -all_hex     |    lst file which contains all the input hex files.
   -hex         |    Input HEX file.
   -hexmod_log  |    Merged Logfile for hexmod.
   -hexmod18    |    To identify it is MDG1 project.
   -abm_out     |    Output XML file for ABM.
   -abm_t       |    Template input file for ABM.   
----------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Example:
	
--rule_t      _gen/swb/module/hexmod/RULES.XT
--in_t        _gen/swb/module/hexmod/INPUT.XT
--info_t      _gen/swb/module/hexmod/INFOBLOCK.XT
--out_t       _gen/swb/module/hexmod/OUTPUT.XT
--abm_t       _gen/swb/module/hexmod/ABM.XT
--core_exp    _gen/swb/module/coreproc/filelist_gen_merged_exp.txt
--all_hex     _gen/swb/module/hexmod/all_hex_files.lst
--prj_hex     _gen/swb/module/hexmod/MG1CS001_P1112_V181_PROTOTYPE_src.hex
--hex         _gen/swb/module/hexmod/MG1CS001_P1112_V181_PROTOTYPE_tmp.hex
--hexmod18    
--lyt          0x20
--rule        _gen/swb/module/hexmod/rule_merge.xml
--in          _gen/swb/module/hexmod/input_merge.xml
--info        _gen/swb/module/hexmod/infoblock_merge.xml
--out         _gen/swb/module/hexmod/output_merge.xml
--abm_out     _gen/swb/module/hexmod/abm_gen.xml
--hexmod_log   _log/swb/module/hexmod/hexmod_merge.log
--trimmed_hex_file_infoblocks_hex 	_bin/swb/filegroup/results/prj_name_trimmed_infoblocks.hex
--trimmed_hex_file_infoblocks		bootctrl
--trimmed_hex_file_infoblocks_out 	_gen/swb/module/hexmod/trimmed_infoblocks_output.xml

	
